From 7955afe70a79403c03225c9951befc30ddbcf7d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Lamparter <chunkeey@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2020 10:42:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 101/312] carl9170: remove P2P_GO support
