From 4ef2f4980ec585f33355f7615cc402ebf9fd1f22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christophe JAILLET <christophe.jaillet@wanadoo.fr>
Date: Sat, 9 May 2020 10:23:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 157/312] power: supply: lp8788: Fix an error handling path in
